    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Like priests who serve the Light, holy paladins are devout in their faith. After spending much of their lives in hallowed halls studying divine doctrine, those who pledge themselves to a holy order become beacons of the Light for their allies in conflict, taking up the heavy armor and weaponry of justice. The truth and virtue of the Light imbues these sacred knights with the power to revitalize their comrades.</p><h2>Path of the Holy Spells</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Paladin Level</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.xmDBqZhRVrtLP8h2]{Protection from Evil and Good}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.spells.Item.GuBrM6ywo6ltQbvy]{Repentance}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.spells.Item.a2YF04ALK88MDjiQ]{Holy Prism}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.F0GsG0SJzsIOacwV]{Lesser Restoration}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ZU9d6woBdUP8pIPt]{Beacon of Hope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.LmRHHMtplpxr9fX6]{Revivify}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.spells.Item.wVL4QWP8ygblhZN0]{Divine Shield}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.TgHsuhNasPbhu8MO]{Guardian of Faith}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"60\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17th</p></td><td><p>Holy Weapon, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.Pyzmm8R7rVsNAPsd]{Mass Cure Wounds}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
